# The libretro cores SovEmu ships, read by scripts/install-cores.sh (the container image's
# `cores` stage). They come prebuilt from a libretro *stable* release (the bundle RetroArch
# ships for Linux x86_64), checked against its SHA-256, never from nightly builds. x86_64 only:
# libretro's stable releases have no Linux arm64 cores.
#
# To move to a newer stable release: change the version and the hash (sha256sum of
# RetroArch_cores.7z from https://buildbot.libretro.com/stable/<version>/linux/x86_64/), rebuild
# the image (it runs `sovemu-worker probe` over every core, so one that cannot load fails the
# build), and bump FBNEO_COMMIT in SovEmu.Server/src/metadata/fbneo.rs to the FBNeo in the
# release (its probe version ends in the commit).
#
# Lines:
#   release <version> <sha256 of RetroArch_cores.7z>
#   core <name>                                  <name>_libretro.so is taken from the bundle
#   data <repo> <commit> <path in repo> <dest>   a data folder a core needs, copied to
#                                                <cores>/system/<dest> (the worker overlays it
#                                                on the BIOS folder)
#
# Licences: fceumm, gambatte, mgba and pcsx_rearmed are GPL/MPL; snes9x, genesis_plus_gx and
# fbneo are non-commercial. SovEmu is non-commercial, so all are usable (see docs/ARCHITECTURE.md).

release 1.22.2 4b7ed8dc97d4bf035fce182c64b5658c7662e2e9e5d42129538afbd4b6096307

core fceumm
core snes9x
core mgba
core gambatte
core genesis_plus_gx
core pcsx_rearmed
core fbneo
# 3D cores: render with OpenGL through the frontend's EGL context (a GPU, or Mesa's llvmpipe).
core mupen64plus_next
core flycast
core dolphin
core pcsx2

# Dolphin's Sys (fonts, game settings) and PCSX2's game database. Not in the release bundle,
# and libretro's asset zips of them are rebuilt nightly, so they come from git at pinned commits.
data https://github.com/libretro/dolphin.git  0863ee3700978e826b0d95b72d4742e537a7325b  Data/Sys       dolphin-emu/Sys
data https://github.com/libretro/ps2.git      9691a4f995862436c3d25ce686ac3bd02065ad62  bin/resources  pcsx2/resources
